{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09120","headline":"送冯着受李广州署爲录事 · 韦应物","name":"送冯着受李广州署爲录事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郁郁杨柳枝，萧萧征马悲。\n送君灞陵岸，纠郡南海湄。\n名在翰墨场，羣公正追随。\n如何从此去，千里万里期。\n大海吞东南，横岭隔地维。\n建邦临日域，温燠御四时。\n百国共臻奏，珍奇献京师。\n富豪虞兴戎，绳墨不易持。\n州伯荷天宠，还当翊丹墀。\n子爲门下生，终始岂见遗。\n所愿酌贪泉，心不爲磷缁。\n上将玩国士，下以报渴饥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}